have to resist that

00:40:02.034 --> 00:40:03.934
because the history
of that exercise

00:40:03.934 --> 00:40:07.574
is one of abject
failure persistently.

00:40:07.574 --> 00:40:10.074
So to say it was actually magic,

00:40:10.074 --> 00:40:12.414
